            "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_20250830_181419_876.webp",
            "heading": "",
            "text_content": "<p></p><p></p><p>SEVA was born from a deeply personal journey-a story of pain, healing, and transformation. Our founder, Ash, created SEVA as a healing ritual during one of the hardest chapters of her life.</p><p>At eight months pregnant, she suffered a serious neck injury that left her bedbound for years. As she navigated motherhood, chronic pain, hormonal imbalance, and hair loss due to severe stress, she began questioning everything- from conventional medicine to the products she trusted.</p><p>What she uncovered was startling- the wellness and beauty industries are filled with hidden toxins, hormone disruptors, and synthetic fillers. Living in constant chronic pain and trapped in fight-or-flight, she realised she needed more than surface-level fixes. She needed ways to calm and regulate her nervous system- rituals that supported both her body and mind.</p><p>Listening to her body, she turned to ancestral wisdom of her heritage—hand-blending oils and treating her scalp as an extension of her nervous system.</p><p>What began as a personal remedy became a ritual of healing.</p><p>That ritual became SEVA.<br/><br/></p>",
