        "ai_gen_block_f2f36a2_ybPYPP": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_f2f36a2",
          "name": "Block quote",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "quote_text": "As someone deeply mindful of what I put on and in my body, I found it incredibly hard to find truly clean, non-toxic products that aligned with my values. I remember walking into store after store, reading labels, researching ingredients—and leaving empty-handed. There were so few options that felt safe, honest, or inclusive.\n\nAs a mother of two, I urge us all to start questioning not just what we put on ourselves, but what we’re giving our children, too. I created SEVA to offer something real, rooted, and respectful for those of us who’ve felt unseen in this space. I hope SEVA becomes part of a new standard in beauty: transparent, inclusive, and deeply nourishing.",
